EK HASHR BAPA HAI DARYA PAR &ndash; BE DAST HUWA IBNE HYDER<br>
<br>
Tha tegh-e-jafa ka aisa asar &ndash; Majroo huwa Zehra ka jigar<br>
Aur toot gaye Sarwar ki kamar &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder<br>
<br>
Jab Shere Jari ghode se gira &ndash; Khush hoke ye kehte the aada<br>
Lo khatm huwa Sheh ka lashkar &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder<br>
<br>
Jab run mein goonji Sheh ki sada &ndash; Kis haal mein hai bhaye mera<br>
Kehte the yehi sab Ahle shar &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder<br>
<br>
Hathon se kamar ko thame huwe &ndash; Ankhon se lahu barsate huwe<br>
Shabbir ye jab paye ye khaber &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder<br>
<br>
Bachon se Sakina kehti thi &ndash; Lane hai gaye ammu pani<br>
Nagah ye run se aaye khabar &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder<br>
<br>
Khaime mein Shahe deen Zainab se &ndash; Ro ro ke yehi farmate the<br>
Chhin jayegi ab teri chadar &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder<br>
<br>
Maqtal mein ye kehte the aada &ndash; Shabbir ka jab kateinge gala<br>
Hoga na koi usdam Yawar &ndash; Be dast huwa Ibne Hyder
